{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/9c7a09e2473932c085a0cbeba3a05405.avif?t=1756181794\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a thousand years of slumber, the world is no longer the same. Humanity has changed, civilizations have fallen\u2026 yet Easter Island remains silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoying your retirement on this quiet island, all you have to do is keep clicking and harvesting dozens of crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Let the ancient vampire\u2019s night harvest begin! \ud83c\udf1b\ud83e\udd87</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Basic Tips &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking more tiles gives you access to new crop varieties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking boosts planting, watering, fertilizing, harvesting, and movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your stamina lets you work longer in the field. (Stamina refills when you sleep.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilizer helps your crops grow 2x faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protector bats keep your crops safe from pests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your inventory lets you carry more crops to the market, allowing you to earn more points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sit back and enjoy discovering 55+ crop varieties.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5b335178c2bd7041b13c6a5cd827fd9c.poster.avif?t=1756181794\" width=320 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5b335178c2bd7041b13c6a5cd827fd9c.webm?t=1756181794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5b335178c2bd7041b13c6a5cd827fd9c.mp4?t=1756181794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919620?t=1756181794","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919620?t=1756181794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/96de0208010b978b8cd3f2962d11220eb44c9775/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756181794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/96de0208010b978b8cd3f2962d11220eb44c9775/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756181794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/9c7a09e2473932c085a0cbeba3a05405.avif?t=1756181794\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a thousand years of slumber, the world is no longer the same. Humanity has changed, civilizations have fallen\u2026 yet Easter Island remains silent. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoying your retirement on this quiet island, all you have to do is keep clicking and harvesting dozens of crop varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Let the ancient vampire\u2019s night harvest begin! \ud83c\udf1b\ud83e\udd87</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Basic Tips &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking more tiles gives you access to new crop varieties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking boosts planting, watering, fertilizing, harvesting, and movement speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your stamina lets you work longer in the field. (Stamina refills when you sleep.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fertilizer helps your crops grow 2x faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protector bats keep your crops safe from pests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your inventory lets you carry more crops to the market, allowing you to earn more points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sit back and enjoy discovering 55+ crop varieties.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5b335178c2bd7041b13c6a5cd827fd9c.poster.avif?t=1756181794\" width=320 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5b335178c2bd7041b13c6a5cd827fd9c.webm?t=1756181794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/extras/5b335178c2bd7041b13c6a5cd827fd9c.mp4?t=1756181794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["mikolus"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919620/b8f56380377c636c0189cd9b55d00098b79e0890/header.jpg?t=1756181794","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257186892,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186892/mov